Logline: Completion on a missing file URI, a directory URI, and a body with no position does not crash or hang. A path that contains `..` is not read.
Setup: Worktree `/home/jeryd/.grok/worktrees/ooda-lsp-complete`. Proof file is `cli/lsp_complete.oo`. `bin/ooda` is absent. INT rebuilds later.
Beats:
