## 0. Verdict

PASS

| attack | verdict | why |
| --- | --- | --- |
| missing file URI | PASS | `path_exists` is false. `lsp_comp_load` returns `""`. |
| directory URI | PASS | `read_file` returns Err. `lsp_comp_load` returns `""`. No hang. |
| body with no position | PASS | `lsp_json_int` returns 0. Prefix at (0,0). No crash. |
| path containing `..` | PASS | `str_index_of(p, "..")` returns before any IO. |

`cli/lsp_complete.oo` already refuses `..` and missing files with empty src.
No product fix. Did not edit `cli/lsp_complete.oo`. Did not edit `cli/lsp_reply.oo`.
