## 1. Loader on disk

  File: `cli/lsp_complete.oo` `lsp_comp_load` (lines 51-68).

    p = path after `file://` until `"`
    if p == ""            -> ""
    if p contains `..`    -> ""
    if !path_exists(fs, p) -> ""
    read_file; on Err     -> ""

  `read_file` is after the `..` check. A `..` URI never reaches `path_exists`.
  Empty src is the fail-closed buffer. `lsp_complete_result` still builds
  a CompletionList from the 30-item catalog. `isIncomplete` stays false.

## 2. Missing file URI — PASS

  Body: `file://fixtures/lsp_complete_no_such.oo` plus a position.
  `lsp_comp_uri` yields that path. It has no `..`.
  `path_exists` is false. Load returns `""`.
  `lsp_src_offset("", 0, 0)` returns 0.
  `lsp_ident_at("", 0)` sees `n <= 0` and returns `""`.
  `lsp_comp_prefix` keeps `start == 0` and returns `""`.
  Empty prefix matches every label. Catalog. No crash. No hang.

## 3. Directory URI — PASS

  Body: `file://fixtures`. Path `fixtures` exists and is a directory.
  Host C `fopen("fixtures", "rb")` succeeds. `path_exists` is therefore true.
  Host `fread` of that FILE returns n=0 and `ferror=1`.
  `oo_read_file` (`runtime/chs_rt_fs.c`) releases the buffer and returns Err.
  `lsp_comp_load` returns `""`. Same empty-src path as a missing file.

  Directory is not a hang. `fixtures` st_size is tens of KB. `fread` fails
  on the first call. No while walks the directory. No crash.

  PV1 did not add `fs_is_dir`. Empty src already holds. Seed rebuild
  is INT. Do not grow the loader.

## 4. Body with no position — PASS

  `lsp_json_int` (`cli/lsp_ident.oo`) returns 0 when `"line":` or
  `"character":` is absent, or when the key has no digits.
  `lsp_complete_result` then calls `lsp_comp_prefix(src, 0, 0)`.

  If the URI is the probe, src is the probe text. Offset 0 is `/` of
  the header comment. `lsp_ident_at` is not a name char. Prefix `""`.
  If the URI is missing or `..`, src is `""`. Prefix `""`.
  Catalog either way. No `char_at` on an empty string.
  No unbounded loop (`ln < line` is false when line is 0).

## 5. Path containing `..` — PASS

  Check is a substring. Order is extract, then `..`, then exists, then read.
  These URIs all return `""` and never call `read_file`:

    file://../secret.oo
    file://fixtures/../fixtures/lsp_complete_probe.oo
    file://foo/bar/..

  The second path would resolve to the real probe if the check were
  after `realpath`. It is not. The substring fires first. The probe
  is not read.

  Smoke lock (INT, after rebuild): isolated completion at the `&Fs`
  cursor on `file://fixtures/../fixtures/lsp_complete_probe.oo`.
  Refuse => empty prefix => item `"label":"fn"`.
  Read-through => prefix `&Fs` => no `fn`. Fail closed on `fn` absent.

## 6. Crash and hang

  Every while on the complete path increments or decrements a cursor
  bounded by `chars_len`. MEM already scored that in `plan1_mem.oot`.
  PV1 adds: missing, directory, and no-position all reduce to empty
  prefix or a single ident slice. `lsp_comp_take` is 30 straight calls.
  Hang budget in the smoke is `timeout 10` on `./bin/ooda lsp`.

